_id":"mhrW9O0O5hXGXGnEYBVoag","name":"Jacques-Imo's Cafe","shared_categories":"","shared_category_count":0},{"business_id":"8KnMSrMuTI2AtHZ2LOI8OQ","name":"Maurepas Foods","shared_categories":"","shared_category_count":0},{"business_id":"Zi-F-YvyVOK0k5QD7lrLOg","name":"Muriel's Jackson Square","shared_categories":"","shared_category_count":0}],"text":[{"business_id":"GoCciHCrpumKGFrUwWKxaQ","review_id":"uYRA4NcGNcLurd4mjox9wA","date":"2016-10-13T16:19:38","stars":5,"text_representativeness":0.9460415840148926,"text_excerpt":"I think this was started with the intent of being an affordable food option, so if you're expecting cheap, set your expectations to average price and you won't be disappointed. This market feels like a Fresh Market with a full bar and raw oyster bar in the middle. They have happy hour Monday thru Saturday (maybe Sunday too? Don't remember). There's a large tv so you could watch sports there as well. What I love is you can pick something from the bakery, raw bar or any part of the market and sit at the bar and eat it after paying. Staff was laid back and friendly, it wasn't busy when we were there Saturday afternoon which was nice. I'd definitely go back."},{"business_id":"GoCciHCrpumKGFrUwWKxaQ","review_id":"ouX1S55vDiRAE_4WxbFTww","date":"2017-04-11T01:40:54","stars":4,"text_representativeness":0.9421559572219849,"text_excerpt":"I like this place. The hot bar is amazing. Chef Allison is the truth! Great food and variety. The market has a wide selection of products and local produce. I went to two great events there and I really enjoy the space. I have yet to try the bar, but I'm saving it for casual date. I think it will be prefect."},{"business_id":"GoCciHCrpumKGFrUwWKxaQ","review_id":"oQsdN5xhtdDOciPz7L1o4w","date":"2016-09-06T16:33:08","stars":5,"text_representativeness":0.9407656192779541,"text_excerpt":"I can't believe I haven't heard more about this place before I went! I went during happy hour and hung out at the bar enjoying some $3 bourbon and ginger cocktails and my guy ordered some $3 local drafts. That in itself will win us over. But we stayed and chat with the bartender who was awesome and ended up staying for food. We ordered a Cuban sandwich and fries to snack on and loved it. Great cuts of meat, delicious bread, and all the right toppings. There was a food demonstration going on that could also be sampled and we got a copy of the recipe from the chef. Very cool in my book. After a couple drinks we walked around to all the different areas of the market. Picked out some perfect ..."}],"visual":[{"business_id":"GoCciHCrpumKGFrUwWKxaQ","photo_id":"iB78PD9tVtTUH85SHCqZLA","label":"outside","image_url":"/photos/iB78PD9tVtTUH85SHCqZLA.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.9116227626800537},{"business_id":"GoCciHCrpumKGFrUwWKxaQ","photo_id":"VKXOJ6kAWwfx9eqN5FO5PA","label":"inside","image_url":"/photos/VKXOJ6kAWwfx9eqN5FO5PA.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.809411346912384},{"business_id":"GoCciHCrpumKGFrUwWKxaQ","photo_id":"K1_pemSY0MbmQhM2Yvojqg","label":"inside","image_url":"/photos/K1_pemSY0MbmQhM2Yvojqg.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.7618786096572876}]},"notebook_case":null}
